Z||000000||theogre||02-21-2001||09:18 PM||||<A HREF="http://theogre.shorturl.com/" TARGET=_blank>The Ogre Cave</A> got a face lift today. It now has a consistant style to it. I'll be working over some of the older article in the near future. (This is the home of the Fiero Cave.)<P><A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>The Ogre's Fiero Cave</A> got a new article with some of the more common brake items. It's in body & chassis.<P>The new brake article also has my overall impression of the Grand Am upgrade. It's likely not to be popular with some people. I've abandoned all plans to use that upgrade on my own car. I am still working on the various other items in the brake math thread in the tech section.||||reg||10
